        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, lorry 16t</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, lorry 16t
For the disposal of steel aluminium  and cooper a cut off allocation is applied. ;
UUID: 510aa2c1-3d9f-40a1-938a-2d397443dd74
The inventory includes disposal processes for bulk materials. For the disposal of tyres a cut off allocation is applied. However, the transportation of tyres to the cement works is taken into account
Location: Data represent Swiss conditions
Technology: no technologies are specified
Time period: Data represents conditions of the 1990ties
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data is based on the material consumption of vehicles. For the transportation of used tyres an expert estimate is used. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_510aa2c1-3d9f-40a1-938a-2d397443dd74.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
